Register-map references (no third-party code included)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

* main/touch.c
    The ST7123 touch-controller register addresses and touch-data bit layout
    follow the ESPHome ST7123 touchscreen component
    (https://github.com/esphome/esphome), which is licensed under GPLv3. Only
    the hardware register map — addresses and bit fields, which are functional
    facts dictated by the silicon — was used as a reference; no ESPHome source
    code was copied. This file is original work and is not a derivative of any
    GPL-licensed code.
